    signal p17 ~ pin 17
    signal p18 ~ pin 18
    signal p19 ~ pin 19
    signal p20 ~ pin 20
    signal p21 ~ pin 21
    signal p22 ~ pin 22
    signal p23 ~ pin 23
    signal p24 ~ pin 24
    signal p25 ~ pin 25
    signal p26 ~ pin 26
    signal p27 ~ pin 27
    signal p28 ~ pin 28
    signal p29 ~ pin 29
    signal p30 ~ pin 30
